    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d578">

                <pb facs="0491" n="375" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg375"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.51/374.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Blanchard to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-12-24T16:00:00-04:49">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 24, 1914, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Bill for issue of eight million gourdes paper money promulgated. It does not
                    contemplate participation or assistance by the Bank in advance of reversion.
                    There is no clause providing that in case of an agreement with the Bank the
                    issue will not be made. Extra session of Congress closed yesterday.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Blanchard</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
